@startuml
title SplitSmart split allocation and reconciliation

start
:Read expense total, currency, participants and split inputs;
if (Positive amount and supported currency policy available?) then (yes)
  if (Distinct active group members; submitter included?) then (yes)
    if (Equal split?) then (equal)
      :Calculate exact ideal shares;
    else (percentage)
      if (All percentages nonnegative and total exactly 100%?) then (yes)
        :Calculate exact ideal shares;
      else (no)
        :Return input error; create no expense;
        stop
      endif
    endif
    :Convert to approved minor-unit scale;
    :Allocate indivisible remainder using owner-approved deterministic rule;
    if (Sum of shares equals expense total exactly?) then (yes)
      :Return shares and applied policy/version;
      :Persist only as pending review with submission transaction;
    else (no)
      :Return reconciliation failure; persist nothing;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Reject participants; persist nothing;
  endif
else (no)
  :Reject amount or block until currency policy approved;
endif
stop

note right
Currency scale, rounding and tie-break remain owner decisions.
Do not treat the proposed largest-remainder policy as approved.
end note
@enduml
